          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said to Moses, “Come up to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", you and Aaron, Nadab, and Abihu, and seventy of the elders of Israel, and worship afar off. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses alone shall come near to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; but the others shall not come near, and the people shall not come up with him.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
