          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses came and told the people all the words of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and all the ordinances; and all the people answered with one voice, and said, “All the words which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has spoken we will do.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses wrote all the words of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". And he rose early in the morning, and built an altar at the foot of the mountain, and twelve pillars, according to the twelve tribes of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he sent young men of the people of Israel, who offered burnt offerings and sacrificed peace offerings of oxen to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses took half of the blood and put it in basins, and half of the blood he threw against the altar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he took the book of the covenant, and read it in the hearing of the people; and they said, “All that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has spoken we will do, and we will be obedient.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
