        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses went up on the mountain, and the cloud covered the mountain. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The glory of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " settled on Mount Sinai, and the cloud covered it six days; and on the seventh day he called to Moses out of the midst of the cloud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the appearance of the glory of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was like a devouring fire on the top of the mountain in the sight of the people of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses entered the cloud, and went up on the mountain. And Moses was on the mountain forty days and forty nights.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
